msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Argh... I took that online course for military style\r\n"
"close quarters combat... and for what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Your camouflage didn't work either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Well? Did you catch the perv?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Yeah, it's this guy, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "What's with those weird goggles?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"These? These are authentic U.S. Army Surplus night vision\r\n"
"goggles! They let you see as easily at night as in the day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"They're battery powered and come complete with infrared and\r\n"
"parfocal zoom! Special ops teams use this very same gear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"I was having such a great time looking around everywhere\r\n"
"I could⑬inside, outside, in the middle of the night..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Yeah, not to mention inside my room!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"True, but it wasn't on purpose. I'm not really into\r\n"
"three-dimensional women... Especially such gaudy ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Hold on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Who asked you, anyway? Creep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"I'm going to take this loser to the police. Sorry I won't\r\n"
"be able to deliver on that good time I promised..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Maybe this'll make up for it, though!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Man... What a night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Hey! What do you think you're doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Huh!? Oh! Uh, nothing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"That sure doesn't look like nothing. Now hurry up and get\r\n"
"down from there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Damn... How could I let this happen...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Oof!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Well done. You spotted me even in my urban camouflage.\r\n"
"Are you also one of... them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Do you know how many people in Japan go missing in a single\r\n"
"year?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"Heheheh... Now that you've met me, I'm afraid I can't\r\n"
"let you live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "This is the end of the line for you, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"I think that awful ogler is back. Can you look right around\r\n"
"my window?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid ""
"Actually... Whenever I've been at home, I've had the feeling that\r\n"
"someone's looking in on me. It gives me the creeps!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid ""
"So I was hoping a tough-looking guy like you could maybe\r\n"
"look into it for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "So that's what this is about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"Just thinking about it makes my skin crawl. I can't even be\r\n"
"comfortable in my own home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid ""
"I live right over there. Do you think you could keep an eye\r\n"
"out for that disgusting creep, whoever he is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "We can have our good time afterward. Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "...If you say so. I'll stake out the area, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid ""
"I'll go back to my place and call you if anything happens.\r\n"
"Can you give me your phone number?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Sure. Here you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Thanks a lot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Button_R3@Adventure> to switch to a first-person perspective "
"and\r\n"
"make sure there are no shady characters lurking nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"(There might be some suspicious individuals waiting nearby.\r\n"
"I should take a look around the premises.)"
msgstr ""

